## Original Content
Власти Канады вводят с 8 сентября пошлины в размере 15%, 25% и 50% в отношении ряда товаров из США, говорится в заявлении министерства финансов Канады.

## Summary
Canada has announced retaliatory tariffs on various US goods starting September 8, with rates of 15%, 25%, and 50% as per the Canadian Ministry of Finance.

## Key Points
- Canada imposes retaliatory tariffs on US goods.
- Tariffs take effect on September 8.
- Tariff rates vary between 15%, 25%, and 50% depending on the goods.
- The announcement is made by the Canadian Ministry of Finance.


